-- 0188: 33 Ibn Fāris aṣl rows announced several core meanings («أصلان / ثلاثة أصول») but named fewer — ارض never said
-- 'earth'. Each now quotes every meaning in his own words (pieces joined with « … », continuation blocks in the note)
-- and the English names each one plainly. Every piece checked against his entry. is_primary untouched.
-- Ibn Faris (maqayis_lugha) asl rows that announced N core meanings but named fewer.
